    "title": "Rooster Cogburn Ostrich Ranch offers monster truck tours, hands-on animal encounters - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Zack Perry ,\n1 days ago PICACHO — About an hour south of Phoenix, Rooster Cogburn Ostrich Ranch is drawing visitors with a mix of wildlife encounters and off-road adventure. The family-owned ranch, located near Picacho Peak, features over a dozen of interactive experiences, including feeding ostriches, goats, ducks and rainbow lorikeets. Guests can even pet stingrays, making the attraction a hands-on destination for all ages. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
